MIT License — STUB FOR TEMPLATE PURPOSES ONLY

This file demonstrates that `LICENSE` (UPPERCASE, no extension) is one of
the canonical meta-files. It is NOT a real license assignment; it is a
placeholder so that copying this template produces a layout that matches
the policy.

When you adopt this template:

1. Replace this file with a real license (or delete and re-add via your
   tooling, e.g. `npx mit-license`, `cargo new`, etc.).
2. Keep the filename as `LICENSE` (or `LICENSE.md` / `LICENSE.txt` if your
   ecosystem prefers an extension; pick one and be consistent).
3. Do not commit this stub as the actual license of any real project.

See `template/README.md` for the full capitalization policy explanation.
